--[[
    Survive the Apocalypse - Admin/Developer Menu
    Place this as a LocalScript inside StarterGui or StarterPlayerScripts.
    Only runs for players in the AdminList below.
    
    TABS:
      [Player]   - Speed, Jump, God Mode, Noclip, Infinite Hunger, Fly
      [Weapons]  - Give any gun or melee from ReplicatedStorage
      [Items]    - Give tools, potions, special items
      [Armor]    - Give armor sets and backpacks
      [Ammo]     - Give ammo types and resources
      [Food]     - Give food/consumables
      [World]    - Time of day, weather, power plants, radiation
      [Players]  - Manage all players in server
      [Spawn]    - Spawn items into workspace near character
]]

